---
import '@fontsource/bricolage-grotesque/700.css';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/webp" href="/logo-mark.webp" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://twistor.co/logo-mark.webp" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Dental AI Front Office | Twistor" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Never lose a patient to voicemail again." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://twistor.co/products/dental-front-office/" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Dental AI Front Office | Twistor" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Never lose a patient to voicemail again." />
    <title>Dental AI Front Office | Twistor</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Never lose a patient to voicemail again." />
    <style>
      :root { --bg: #FAF7F2; --surface: #FFFFFF; --ink: #1C1A17; --muted: #5F5A54; --accent: #FF5A1F; --accent-text: #B5430E; --line: #E5DFD5; }
      body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; }
      header, main, footer { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
      header { padding-top: 24px; padding-bottom: 8px; }
      header a { color: var(--accent-text); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
      a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--accent-text); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 4px; }
      h1, h2 { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; }
      h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 24px 0 8px; font-weight: 700; }
      h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 32px 0 8px; font-weight: 700; }
      .tagline { color: var(--accent-text); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .price { display: inline-block; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 24px; font-size: 1rem; }
      p { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); }
      ul { padding-left: 20px; }
      li { margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1rem; }
      li::marker { color: var(--accent); }
      .cta-link { color: var(--accent-text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; text-decoration: none; }
      .cta-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      footer { padding: 40px 24px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 48px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header><a href="/">← Twistor</a></header>
    <main>
      <h1>Dental AI Front Office</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Never lose a patient to voicemail again.</p>
      <div class="price">$2,500 setup + $750/mo</div>
      <h2>What it does</h2>
      <ul>
          <li>AI voice receptionist answers every call: books, reschedules, and triages urgency.</li>
          <li>Real booking inside your Dentrix / Open Dental. Nothing retyped.</li>
          <li>SMS reminders and confirmations that cut no-shows</li>
          <li>Instant missed-call text-back in under a minute</li>
          <li>Automated review requests with unhappy-patient routing</li>
          <li>Monthly revenue-recovered report, in plain English</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Who it's for</h2>
      <p>Solo and small-group dental practices (1–5 chairs) that miss calls during procedures.</p>
      <h2>Talk to us</h2>
      <p>Tell us about your shop. We reply within one business day.</p>
      <p><a class="cta-link" href="mailto:twistorhq@gmail.com?subject=Demo%20request%20%E2%80%94%20Twistor">Email us to book a demo →</a></p>
    </main>
    <footer>© 2026 Twistor Holdings LLC · Built on Twistor Core</footer>
  </body>
</html>
